    "%@ の「基準をやや超える」だけでは判定に使えません。「基準内」も入力してください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ cannot be assessed from “Slightly exceeds criteria” alone. Enter “Within criteria” as well."
          }
        }
