    "CI(RTOG) = PIV / TV\nCI(Paddick) = TV_PIV² / (TV × PIV)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CI(RTOG) = PIV / TV\nCI(Paddick) = TV_PIV² / (TV × PIV)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coverage（90% / 80% 等線量線が標的を完全に覆うかの判定）は真偽の判定であり数値指標ではないため、本アプリはこの入力を持たず判定していません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coverage (whether the 90% / 80% isodose line fully encloses the target) is a yes/no determination rather than a numerical index, so this app does not take that input and does not assess it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
