    "PIV は処方線量以上を受ける全体積、PTV∩PIV は PTV のうち処方線量以上を受ける体積、V50% は処方線量の 50% 以上を受ける体積。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PIV is the total volume receiving at least the prescription dose, PTV∩PIV is the part of the PTV receiving at least the prescription dose, and V50% is the volume receiving at least 50% of the prescription dose."
          }
        }
      }
