    "https://yhi264.github.io/pocketrt/privacy/" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "https://yhi264.github.io/pocketrt/privacy/"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "n は分割回数、d は 1 回線量（= 総線量 ÷ n）、α/β は組織固有のパラメータです。\nLinear-Quadratic モデルに基づき、分割の違いを揃えて比較するための指標です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "n is the number of fractions, d the dose per fraction (= total dose ÷ n), and α/β a tissue-specific parameter.\nBased on the linear-quadratic model, these indices allow schedules with different fractionation to be compared on a common basis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
