    "• 施設のプロトコル" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Your institution’s protocol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 最新のガイドライン（JASTRO, NCCN, ESTRO 等）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Current guidelines (JASTRO, NCCN, ESTRO, etc.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠ 再照射では回復係数(recovery factor)を考慮する必要があります。本計算は単純加算であり、再照射計画には用いないでください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠ Re-irradiation requires a recovery factor to be taken into account. This calculation is a simple sum and must not be used for re-irradiation planning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、" : {
      "comment" : "登録した閾値どうしの区切り",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ", "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「基準内」未満なら基準内、「許容」未満なら基準をやや超える、それ以上は基準を超える。「許容」は空欄にできます（2 段階になります）。定めていない指標は両方空欄のままにしてください。少なくとも 1 つの指標に「基準内」の入力が必要です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Below the “Within criteria” value counts as within criteria, below the “Acceptable” value as slightly exceeding criteria, and anything above that as exceeding criteria. “Acceptable” may be left blank (giving a two-level scale). Leave both fields blank for indices you have not defined. At least one index must have a “Within criteria” value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
