            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Individual break"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "値が範囲外のプリセットがあるため、何も取り込みませんでした: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing was imported because some presets have values out of range: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "値が範囲外の基準があるため、何も取り込みませんでした: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing was imported because some criteria have values out of range: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "元の制約" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Original schedule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "元の制約（総線量と分割数）から BED を求め、それと等しい BED になる別の分割を逆算します。\n分割数を指定した場合は上式で 1 回線量 d' を解きます。\n1 回線量を指定した場合は n' = BED / (d'·(1 + d'/(α/β))) を計算し、整数に丸めます。\nこの丸めにより、1 回線量を指定したときの結果は元の BED と厳密には一致しません。\n表示される BED は、丸めた分割数で再計算した値です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BED is computed from the original schedule (total dose and number of fractions), and an alternative schedule with the same BED is derived.\nIf you specify the number of fractions, the dose per fraction d′ is solved from the equation above.\nIf you specify the dose per fraction, n′ = BED / (d′·(1 + d′/(α/β))) is computed and rounded to an integer.\nBecause of this rounding, the result obtained by specifying the dose per fraction does not match the original BED exactly.\nThe BED shown is recomputed from the rounded number of fractions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "元日" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New Year’s Day"
