    "判定" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Assessment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判定しない" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not assessed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判定基準は Shaw E, et al. Radiation Therapy Oncology Group: radiosurgery quality assurance guidelines. Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys. 1993 の本文 p.1235「Quality assurance review」節から逐字転記しています。RTOG 0813 / 0915 の判定表がプロトコル文書にあり論文には載っていないのとは異なり、この判定基準は公表論文の本文そのものに記載されています。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The criteria are transcribed verbatim from the “Quality assurance review” section on p. 1235 of Shaw E, et al. Radiation Therapy Oncology Group: radiosurgery quality assurance guidelines. Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys. 1993. Unlike the RTOG 0813 / 0915 tables, which appear in the protocol documents and not in the published papers, these criteria are stated in the body of the published paper itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判定表は RTOG 0813 / 0915 のプロトコル文書 Table 1（いずれも p.16「Conformality of Prescribed Dose for Calculations Based on Deposition of Photon Beam Energy in Heterogeneous Tissue」）から転記しています。両プロトコルの表は逐字照合の結果、誤植を含めて完全に同一でした。下に挙げた論文は各試験の設計と結果を報告するもので、この表そのものは含みません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The assessment table is transcribed from Table 1 of the RTOG 0813 / 0915 protocol documents (in both cases p. 16, “Conformality of Prescribed Dose for Calculations Based on Deposition of Photon Beam Energy in Heterogeneous Tissue”). Verbatim comparison showed the two protocols’ tables to be completely identical, typographical errors included. The papers listed below report the design and results of each trial; they do not contain the table itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判定表は体積の比（R100%、R50%）と処方線量に対する割合（D2cm、V20）だけで定義されており、絶対線量を含みません。このため群や線量レベルによらず共通で、上記のいずれの線量分割にも同じ表を用います。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The table is defined solely in terms of volume ratios (R100%, R50%) and percentages of the prescription dose (D2cm, V20); it contains no absolute doses. It is therefore common to all arms and dose levels, and the same table is used for every fractionation listed above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
