    "単純計算" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calculator"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原典が明示的に定めていない境界（MDPD がちょうど 2.5、PITV がちょうど 0.9 および 2.5）は、安全側（重い方の判定段階）に倒しています。原典が明示している境界（MDPD ≦ 2.0、PITV が 1.0 以上 2.0 未満）はそのまま用いています。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Boundaries that the original does not state explicitly (MDPD exactly 2.5; PITV exactly 0.9 and exactly 2.5) are resolved on the safe side, toward the more severe category. Boundaries the original does state (MDPD ≤ 2.0; PITV from 1.0 up to but not including 2.0) are used as written."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原典の 3 箇所（PTV 3.8 cc の R100% Minor、PTV 126.0 / 163.0 cc の D2cm Minor）は 不等号の向きが他の全行と逆に記されています。値が単調増加していることから誤植と判断し、他の行に揃えて転記しています。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In three places in the original (R100% Minor at PTV 3.8 cc, and D2cm Minor at PTV 126.0 and 163.0 cc) the inequality signs are written in the opposite direction from every other row. Since the values increase monotonically, these were judged to be typographical errors and transcribed in line with the other rows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原典は Coverage・Homogeneity index（MDPD）・Conformity index（PITV）の 3 基準を 定めていますが、本アプリは MDPD と PITV の 2 つだけを判定します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The original defines three criteria — Coverage, Homogeneity index (MDPD) and Conformity index (PITV) — but this app assesses only MDPD and PITV."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "収録された線量分割プリセットは代表例の参考表示であり、最新エビデンスと施設プロトコルとの照合を行ってください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The included fractionation presets are reference examples; please check them against current evidence and your institution’s protocol."
          }
        }
      }
    },
