    "寡分割計算" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hypofractionation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "対象は手術不能の中心型 T1-2（5 cm 以下）N0M0 非小細胞肺癌。10〜12 Gy/Fr の 5 分割で線量漸増した第 1/2 相試験。最大耐容線量は 12.0 Gy/Fr。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Population: medically inoperable centrally located T1–2 (≤ 5 cm) N0M0 non-small-cell lung cancer. A phase 1/2 dose-escalation trial using five fractions of 10–12 Gy. The maximum tolerated dose was 12.0 Gy per fraction."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "対象は手術不能の末梢型（中枢気管支から 2 cm 以上）T1-2 N0M0 非小細胞肺癌。34 Gy/1 Fr（第 1 群）と 48 Gy/4 Fr（第 2 群）を比較した第 2 相ランダム化試験。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Population: medically inoperable peripherally located (≥ 2 cm from the central bronchial tree) T1–2 N0M0 non-small-cell lung cancer. A randomized phase 2 trial comparing 34 Gy in 1 fraction (arm 1) with 48 Gy in 4 fractions (arm 2)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "対象は頭部への定位放射線照射（SRS/SRT）全般。特定の線量分割や臨床試験に紐づかない RTOG の QA の枠組みで、1993 年発表。IMRT/VMAT や多発病変への単一アイソセンター照射が普及する前の文書であり、現在の実務との関係は利用者が判断する。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scope: intracranial stereotactic irradiation (SRS/SRT) in general. An RTOG quality-assurance framework not tied to any particular fractionation or clinical trial, published in 1993. It predates the spread of IMRT/VMAT and single-isocenter treatment of multiple lesions, so users must judge for themselves how it relates to current practice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
