    },
    "本アプリが収録する α/β は代表的な参考値です。同じ組織でも文献によって報告値は一致しません。\n施設のプロトコルと照合してください。\n\n腫瘍（一般）10 Gy / 前立腺癌 1.5 Gy / 乳癌 4 Gy /\n晩期反応組織（一般）3 Gy / 脊髄 2 Gy / 脳幹 2 Gy /\n皮膚（急性）10 Gy / 皮膚（晩期）3 Gy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The α/β values included in this app are representative reference values. Reported values differ between publications even for the same tissue.\nPlease check them against your institution’s protocol.\n\nTumor (general) 10 Gy / Prostate cancer 1.5 Gy / Breast cancer 4 Gy /\nLate-responding tissue (general) 3 Gy / Spinal cord 2 Gy / Brainstem 2 Gy /\nSkin (acute) 10 Gy / Skin (late) 3 Gy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本アプリが扱わないこと" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What this app does not cover"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本アプリに入力された線量、分割回数、治療開始日などの情報は、すべて利用者の端末内でのみ処理されます。開発者を含むいかなる第三者にも送信されることはありません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Doses, numbers of fractions, treatment start dates and any other values entered into the app are processed solely on the user’s own device. They are never transmitted to any third party, the developer included."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本アプリの位置づけ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
