    "表にない PTV 体積は、原典 Note 1「For values of PTV dimension or volume not specified, linear interpolation between table entries is required.」に従って線形補間します。表の範囲（1.8〜163.0 cc）の外では原典に規定がないため、外挿せず判定しません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PTV volumes not listed in the table are linearly interpolated in accordance with Note 1 of the original: “For values of PTV dimension or volume not specified, linear interpolation between table entries is required.” Outside the range of the table (1.8–163.0 cc) the original gives no rule, so no extrapolation is performed and no assessment is made."
          }
        }
      }
    },
